# Files the pr-automation-bot-public bot is allowed to change via automated PRs.
# Each block covers what its workflow stages. Patterns are fnmatch, where `*`
# also matches `/`, so a directory entry covers nested paths.

# sync-motoko: bumps the Motoko submodule and syncs generated docs
.sources/motoko
.sources/VERSIONS
docs/languages/motoko/*

# sync-ii-spec: bumps the Internet Identity submodule and syncs the II spec
.sources/internetidentity
docs/references/internet-identity-spec.md
docs/references/verifiable-credentials-spec.md
public/references/internet-identity.did

# sync-static-site: bumps the certified-assets pin and syncs the static-site pages
.sources/upstream.json
docs/guides/frontends/static-site/*

# update-syntax-grammars: updates TextMate grammars from vscode-motoko releases
syntaxes/*
